  "notes": "v0.34 weapon_stems (docs/weapon_stems.md): source 'smg_burst', rebuilt from stems of a CC0 recording (THIRD_PARTY.md). A single real gesture or a short natural count by default. The seed macro (or any variation) remixes the real stems; nothing is averaged, bands are not pitch-shifted (size is tape speed), and there is no freeze, time-squeeze or added smoothing."
